From: phlink <phlink@local>
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] phlink: default DoH to Secure mode with Cloudflare
 1.1.1.1
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Flip the kDnsOverHttpsMode default from kAutomatic to kSecure and seed
kDnsOverHttpsTemplates with Cloudflare's no-log DoH endpoint
(https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query). Quad9 and NextDNS are already
shipped in net/dns/public/doh_provider_entry.cc and remain selectable
from chrome://settings.

Combined with Phase 4 Wave 1 telemetry kill, this means a fresh phlink
profile makes zero plain-DNS lookups against the OS resolver for any
site in the Cloudflare DoH list, even before the user opens settings.

PRD §3.5, PRIV-DNS-01.
---
 .../net/default_dns_over_https_config_source.cc        | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/net/default_dns_over_https_config_source.cc b/chrome/browser/net/default_dns_over_https_config_source.cc
index e5a2aadcc85f6..1b4d795482728 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/net/default_dns_over_https_config_source.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/net/default_dns_over_https_config_source.cc
@@ -27,9 +27,17 @@ DefaultDnsOverHttpsConfigSource::DefaultDnsOverHttpsConfigSource(
   // result in reentrancy and mess up registration between this code and
   // NetworkService creation.
   if (set_up_pref_defaults) {
+    // phlink: default to "secure" mode with Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 (no-log) so
+    // every fresh profile resolves DNS over HTTPS out of the box (PRD §3.5,
+    // PRIV-DNS-01). Users can switch to Quad9 or NextDNS in chrome://settings;
+    // both ship in the upstream provider list (net/dns/public/
+    // doh_provider_entry.cc).
     local_state->SetDefaultPrefValue(prefs::kDnsOverHttpsMode,
                                      base::Value(SecureDnsConfig::ModeToString(
-                                         net::SecureDnsMode::kAutomatic)));
+                                         net::SecureDnsMode::kSecure)));
+    local_state->SetDefaultPrefValue(
+        prefs::kDnsOverHttpsTemplates,
+        base::Value("https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query"));
   }
 }
 
